{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51423","headline":"句 · 杜牧","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭门客到常疑（一作「如」）病，满院花开不似（一作「未是」）贫。\n（以上《云谿友议》上《冯生佞》。\n又《唐诗纪事》五六、《诗话总龟》三《知遇门》、《诗人玉屑》十《知音》、《唐才子传》七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}